1
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,666
the Lord has spoken to Moses

2
00:00:32,666 --> 00:00:35,466
see I have called by name Bezaleel

3
00:00:35,466 --> 00:00:37,333
the son of Uri, the son of Hur

4
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:38,866
of the tribe of Judah

5
00:00:38,866 --> 00:00:41,400
and I have filled him with the Spirit of God

6
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,333
in wisdom and in understanding

7
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:45,266
and in knowledge and in all manner of workmanship

8
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:47,800
to devise cunning works

9
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,133
to work in gold and in silver and in brass

10
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:52,466
and in cutting of stones to set them

11
00:00:52,466 --> 00:00:54,800
and in carving of timber

12
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:57,133
to work in all manner of workmanship

13
00:00:57,133 --> 00:00:59,466
and I behold I have given with him Aholiab

14
00:00:59,466 --> 00:01:01,800
the son of Ahisamach of the tribe of Dan

15
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:04,133
and in the hearts of all that are wise hearted

16
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:06,466
I have put wisdom

17
00:01:06,466 --> 00:01:08,800
that they may make all that I have commanded thee